{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$59杯!特濃朱古力+陣陣薄荷香</p><p>Godiva新推薄荷朱古力奶昔</p><p>香港Godiva回應網民的期待，隆重推出薄荷朱古力奶昔($59杯)，香港配方嚴選50%濃醇黑朱古力製作，與坊間使用白朱古力製作的薄荷朱古力飲品風味不同，加埋冰爽清新的薄荷完美融合，推出幾日已經有唔少薄朱迷去試！</p><p>Godiva 官方IG：@godivaasia</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178814894498084624_15526131346a94fcd152b6f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178814894689863864_10090339856a94fcd337da0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178814894894335414_12150615906a94fcd5c20df.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178814895120429880_15014959606a94fcd77abf1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178814895325975517_1084760316a94fcd9e2675.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T04:19:00.884616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}